[290.333815, "o", "   ✓ SUPPLY Sheet: 38 product categories with data\r\n   ✓ USE Sheet: 38 product categories with data\r\n   ✓ Sum formulas in row 43: Both sheets\r\n   Status: COMPLETE\r\n\r\n4. SUT CALC SHEET - STEP 1 COMPLETION\r\n   ✓ Linked to SUPPLY sheet (Columns B-C)\r\n   ✓ Linked to USE sheet (Columns D-E)\r\n   ✓ Total row (43): Sum formulas\r\n   ✓ Import content share (C46): Formula in place\r\n   Formula: =IF(D43=0,0,(E43/D43)*100)\r\n   Status: COMPLETE\r\n\r\n5. SCENARIO 1 (BASE CASE) - STEP 2 COMPLETION\r\n   ✓ Real GDP (Column C): Linked to WEO_Data\r\n   ✓ Baseline GDP Growth (Column J): Linked to WEO_Data\r\n   ✓ Assumptions (D30-D33):\r\n     - Total Investment: 6500 USD millions\r\n     - Import Content Share: ='SUT Calc'!C46\r\n     - Demand Multiplier: 0.8\r\n     - Project Allocation: Bell shape (2026-2033)\r\n   ✓ Project Allocation (Column D): Bell shape 2026-2033\r\n   ✓ Project Investment (Column E): Formulas in place\r\n   ✓ Imports (Column F): Formulas in place\r\n   ✓ GDP impact (Column G): Formulas in place\r\n   ✓ Multiplier (Column H): Formulas in place\r\n   ✓ % of GDP (Column I): Formulas in place\r\n   ✓ Projected Growth (Column K): Formulas in place\r\n   Status: COMPLETE\r\n\r\n6. SCENARIO 2 - STEP 3 COMPLETION\r\n"]
